  "notes": "docs:guide's SKILL.md fails its check, and the entry skills/get returns names another skill (its frontmatter name is not its URI's), one Entries refuses. The registry keeps the entry it held, as for a server that does not answer: the skill stays available, and its next activation reads its SKILL.md and the entry again, and fails as the first did. An entry the host does not take is shown by served-skills/an-entry-read-again-in-a-form-the-host-does-not-take-leaves-the-skill-unavailable. Python: skills/mcp/catalog.py refresh; roomkit-rs: roomkit-ai skills/served/loading.rs refresh."
